@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@orderId = 1
@itemId = 1
@quoteId = 1
@weighingId = 1
@csrf = PASTE_CURRENT_SESSION_CSRF_TOKEN

### Login with relevant account first (auth-api.http), then fetch fresh token.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

### COLLECTOR: actual order/item IDs and current version
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/collector/orders/{{orderId}}

### ASSIGNED/version 2 -> EN_ROUTE/version 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collector/orders/{{orderId}}/start-trip
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"version":2,"reason":"Bắt đầu di chuyển"}

### EN_ROUTE/version 3 -> ARRIVED/version 4
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collector/orders/{{orderId}}/arrive
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"version":3}

### First weighing: order version 4 -> 5; actual itemId from order detail
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collector/orders/{{orderId}}/weighings
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"version":4,"items":[{"itemId":{{itemId}},"grossWeight":5.25,"tareWeight":0.25}]}

### Weighing history; latest record for each item has greatest id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/collector/orders/{{orderId}}/weighings

### OPTIONAL correction BEFORE sending quote: version 5 -> 6
# If run, use version 6 instead of 5 below and follow returned versions thereafter.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collector/orders/{{orderId}}/weighings
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"version":5,"items":[{"itemId":{{itemId}},"grossWeight":6.25,"tareWeight":0.25,"correctionOf":{{weighingId}},"correctionReason":"Cân lại cùng khách"}]}

### Send quote (assumes no optional correction): version 5 -> 6
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collector/orders/{{orderId}}/quotes
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"version":5}

### CUSTOMER: log in as owner; fetch fresh CSRF after switching account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/orders/{{orderId}}/quotes

### Choose accept OR reject; actual quoteId and version from GET
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/orders/{{orderId}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/accept
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"version":6,"quoteVersion":0,"responseNote":"Đồng ý kết quả cân và báo giá"}

### Alternative reject -> ARRIVED/version 7; collector may correct/requote
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/orders/{{orderId}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"version":6,"quoteVersion":0,"responseNote":"Đề nghị cân lại"}

### ADMIN read-only oversight (log in as ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/quotes
